<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Continual Light</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 24), Paladin (guild level 41)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast continual light &lt;object&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast continual light</a>   (on the room you are in)
</pre>
<p>Makes an object, or the room you stand in, give off a bright light, twice as 
bright as the light spell, and it doesn't wear off: the light stays. Cast it 
on something you carry or wear, and the light goes where you go.
</p><p>It doesn't add up with the light spell: something already lit by either one 
can't be lit again. You must be standing. It is also found on staffs, scrolls 
and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Light</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sun Globe</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Continual Darkness</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>